{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C++", "description": "This file implements a class for dumping protobuf-encoded representation of IR differences, including methods for adding various diff components, compatibility status, and serialization to a file. It is part of the header_checker::repr namespace and interacts heavily with protobuf messages and external IR and protobuf conversion utilities.", "external_files": ["repr/ir_diff_representation.h", "repr/protobuf/api.h", "repr/protobuf/converter.h", "<fstream>", "<memory>", "<string>", "<llvm/Support/raw_ostream.h>", "<google/protobuf/io/zero_copy_stream_impl.h>", "<google/protobuf/text_format.h>"], "external_methods": ["IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertElfFunctionIR", "IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertElfObjectIR", "IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertRecordTypeIR", "IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertFunctionIR", "IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertEnumTypeIR", "IRToProtobufConverter::ConvertGlobalVarIR", "IRDiffToProtobufConverter::ConvertRecordTypeDiffIR", "IRDiffToProtobufConverter::ConvertFunctionDiffIR", "IRDiffToProtobufConverter::ConvertEnumTypeDiffIR", "IRDiffToProtobufConverter::ConvertGlobalVarDiffIR", "CompatibilityStatusIRToProtobuf"], "published": ["CreateProtobufIRDiffDumper"], "classes": [{"name": "ProtobufIRDiffDumper", "description": "A class responsible for accumulating and serializing differences in IR representations using protobuf messages. It provides methods to add specific diff information, set metadata, assess compatibility, and produce a text output of the stored diffs."}], "methods": [{"name": "void AddLibNameIR(const std::string & name)", "description": "Sets the library name in the diff protobuf message.", "scope": "header_checker::repr::ProtobufIRDiffDumper", "scopeKind": "class"}, {"name": "void AddArchIR(const std::string & arch)", "description": "Sets the architecture information in the diff protobuf message.", "scope": "header_checker::repr::ProtobufIRDiffDumper", "scopeKind": "class"}, {"name": "Comp